#Marco Rodriguez User Stories Based on Elicitation Responses

Story 1: As a customer, I need the ability to securely pay a small deposit or save a card on file during the booking process, so that I can guarantee my appointment slot and the store can reduce no show rates.

Story 2: As a store manager, I need the system to require all customers to register their pet details before finalizing a booking, so that our staff is fully prepared for the specific size and needs of the animal arriving.

Story 3: As a product owner, I need the booking system to enforce unique capacity rules and time blocks for grooming, training, and boarding, so that we never overbook our physical kennel space or trainer availability.

Story 4: As a customer, I need to be able to cancel or reschedule my appointment online, so that I can adjust my plans while the system automatically applies any necessary 24 hour cancellation fees or deposit forfeitures.

Story 5: As a returning customer with a registered account, I need to view my past appointments and saved pet profiles, so that I can quickly rebook my favorite services with just a few clicks and receive personalized recommendations.

Story 6: As a product owner, I need a reporting dashboard that tracks the online booking conversion rate, so that I can measure exactly how many customers successfully complete the online flow compared to manual scheduling.

#Sheridan Dela Cruz User Stories on Elicitation Responses (I ranked them as a start)

Story 1. Online Appointment Scheduling (Priority 1)
As a customer, I need to schedule grooming, training, or boarding appointments online so that I can book services at any time without calling the store.

Story 2. Service Selection (Priority 2)
As a customer, I need to choose the specific service my dog needs so that I can book the correct appointment type.

Story 3. Calendar & Time Slot Selection (Priority 3)
As a customer, I need to view available dates and times so that I can select an appointment that fits my schedule.

Story 4. Groomer Daily Schedule View (Priority 4)
As a groomer, I need to see my scheduled appointments for the day so that I can prepare for each pet and manage my workload.

Story 5. Pet Profile Updates (Priority 5)
As a customer, I need to update my pet’s profile information so that groomers have accurate details before the appointment.

Story 6. Groomer Notes & Behavior Logging (Priority 6)
As a groomer, I need to log pet behavior and service notes so that future appointments are informed by past experiences.

#Megan Mosier User Stories on Elicitation Responses, ranked as well

1.	(1st priority) Appointment Scheduling and Reminders
As a customer, I need clear confirmation and reminders for my appointments so that I can trust my bookings went through.  That way I can plan my visit confidently.

2.	(2nd priority) Accurate Availibility
As a staff member, I need the system to show accurate, real time availability, so that I can avoid double booking and manage daily capacity confidently.

3.	(3rd priority) Correct Scheduling Guidelines
As a product owner, I need automated scheduling for each service we have available, so that appointments follow correct durations and capacity limits without relying on manual oversight.

4.	(4th priority) Appointment and Scheduling Modification
As a customer, I need to easily modify or cancel my appointment online, so that I can manage my plans without calling the store or waiting for staff assistance.

5.	(5th priority) Fewer Manual Oversight of Scheduling
As a front desk team member, I need fewer manual scheduling tasks so I can focus on in-person customer service instead of managing calls and correcting booking errors.

6.	(6th priority) Scheduling and Program Analytics
As a product owner, I need clear analytics on booking behavior and system performance, so that I can identify trends, address issues quickly, and guide future improvements.

# Garvin Stewart - User Stories on Elicitation Responses

1. Customer Account Registration and Login
As a customer, I want to create an account and log in securely, so that I can access my pet profiles and manage my appointments without starting over each time.

2. Service-Specific Scheduling Rules
As a staff member, I want the system to enforce capacity limits and time block rules per service type; grooming by duration and groomer, training by group or individual format, boarding by kennel capacity, so that the schedule is always operationally valid.

3. Vaccination Record Upload
As a customer, I want to upload my dog's vaccination records to my pet profile, so that staff can verify compliance before a boarding appointment without requiring me to bring physical documents.

4. Late Cancellation Flagging
As a staff member, I want the system to flag cancellations made within 24 hours of the appointment and log no-shows to the customer's account, so that I have visibility into reliability patterns.

5. Online Payment and Tipping
As a customer, I want to pay for services and tip the groomer online before my appointment, so that the pickup process is faster and cashless.

6. Automated Staff-to-Pet Matching
As a staff member, I want the system to automatically match incoming bookings to the most suitable available staff member based on breed, service type, or history, so that scheduling decisions are made intelligently without manual intervention.
